# (OVER-CARRY 2026-10-23) under a hood (the culture hood or the legacy hood: flag hood) the hood's drape covers the
# shoulders, so the run's flare streams from under it: the back edge one straight line down from the hood's back to the hem
# (no notch between hood and cloak: no backpack lump), the folds running back from the neck, the hem cut back and up
# toward the legs; inside the body's run box (no new column behind the hood: B10). L is the mirror of R.
view R key flare origin 10 0 when hood replace
